      "start_seconds": 1.37,
      "end_seconds": 4.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "good afternoon, how are you today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 5.14,
      "end_seconds": 6.19,
      "duration_seconds": 1.05,
      "text": "hello, doctor"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.82,
      "end_seconds": 11.16,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "right, start wherever you like, I'm listening"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.39,
      "end_seconds": 17.42,
      "duration_seconds": 5.03,
      "text": "Yeah, it's night sweats. I don't know what's causing it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 21.19,
      "end_seconds": 23.5,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "Did it come on recently?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 25.58,
      "end_seconds": 31.1,
      "duration_seconds": 5.52,
      "text": "let me think, you know, I've had it for six months"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 32.02,
      "end_seconds": 40.34,
      "duration_seconds": 8.32,
      "text": "Can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 46.36,
      "end_seconds": 54.58,
      "duration_seconds": 8.22,
      "text": "It happens once or twice a day. It settles a little with changing the sheets."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 62.75,
      "end_seconds": 72.34,
      "duration_seconds": 9.59,
      "text": "here are the numbers, doctor pressure 126 over 71, respiratory rate 15. Heart rate 83, oxygen saturation is 98 percent, temp 36.5 degrees"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 74.4,
      "end_seconds": 75.46,
      "duration_seconds": 1.06,
      "text": "Okay, noted."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 77.43,
      "end_seconds": 81.86,
      "duration_seconds": 4.43,
      "text": "Okay, now I'm going to do a short physical check."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 83.68,
      "end_seconds": 85.4,
      "duration_seconds": 1.72,
      "text": "yeah, no problem"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 86.7,
      "end_seconds": 89.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "Stay as you are for a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 100.05,
      "end_seconds": 105.85,
      "duration_seconds": 5.8,
      "text": "I can feel a couple of small glands in your neck, not tender."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 111.42,
      "end_seconds": 113.31,
      "duration_seconds": 1.89,
      "text": "Please sit back down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 126.24,
      "end_seconds": 128.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.67,
      "text": "did you notice any difficulty swallowing?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 130.78,
      "end_seconds": 134.61,
      "duration_seconds": 3.83,
      "text": "Not that I've noticed, no difficulty swallowing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 135.99,
      "end_seconds": 141.3,
      "duration_seconds": 5.31,
      "text": "Okay, have you had any coughing up blood or bone pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 142.02,
      "end_seconds": 147.58,
      "duration_seconds": 5.56,
      "text": "I haven't had coughing up blood or bone pain, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 149.86,
      "end_seconds": 153.76,
      "duration_seconds": 3.9,
      "text": "Any pins and needles or loss of strength anywhere?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 155.5,
      "end_seconds": 157.67,
      "duration_seconds": 2.17,
      "text": "no, nothing like that"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 158.24,
      "end_seconds": 160.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.67,
      "text": "Any breathing difficulties apart from this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 161.72,
      "end_seconds": 162.84,
      "duration_seconds": 1.12,
      "text": "breathing's normal"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 177.12,
      "end_seconds": 181.23,
      "duration_seconds": 4.11,
      "text": "Do you have any medical conditions I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 181.9,
      "end_seconds": 183.84,
      "duration_seconds": 1.94,
      "text": "No, nothing at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 190.91,
      "end_seconds": 195.35,
      "duration_seconds": 4.44,
      "text": "Any allergies to tablets, food or anything in the environment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 196.35,
      "end_seconds": 199.67,
      "duration_seconds": 3.32,
      "text": "I don't think I have any, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 201.42,
      "end_seconds": 202.29,
      "duration_seconds": 0.87,
      "text": "Any smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 202.9,
      "end_seconds": 206.43,
      "duration_seconds": 3.53,
      "text": "No, I've never smoked in my life."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 208.22,
      "end_seconds": 210.1,
      "duration_seconds": 1.88,
      "text": "and alcohol, how much?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 212.08,
      "end_seconds": 217.43,
      "duration_seconds": 5.35,
      "text": "I used to drink heavily but I stopped four years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 219.5,
      "end_seconds": 222.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "What line of work are you in?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 223.95,
      "end_seconds": 229.31,
      "duration_seconds": 5.36,
      "text": "I'm a bus driver, so I sit for long hours"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 231.35,
      "end_seconds": 235.6,
      "duration_seconds": 4.25,
      "text": "What does a normal day of food look like?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 236.97,
      "end_seconds": 240.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.93,
      "text": "Lots of rice, lentils and some fruit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 242.64,
      "end_seconds": 245.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "any regular medication, tablets or creams?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 246.4,
      "end_seconds": 250.21,
      "duration_seconds": 3.81,
      "text": "No, uh, nothing at the moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 252.13,
      "end_seconds": 259.25,
      "duration_seconds": 7.12,
      "text": "putting it it all together, my working impression is an unexplained weight loss that needs a proper work-up"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 260.75,
      "end_seconds": 263.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "Do you think it's something serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 264.88,
      "end_seconds": 293.3,
      "duration_seconds": 28.42,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's an unexplained weight loss that needs a proper work-up, and we'll know more once the a thyroid test is back. I'll request a thyroid test, it'll help with weight loss. Weigh yourself once a week at the same time and note it down. Avoid taking any extra painkillers on top of what I'm prescribing without checking with us."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 293.76,
      "end_seconds": 310.51,
      "duration_seconds": 16.75,
      "text": "Hm, okay. The chest clinic would be the right next step, I'll refer you. If it hasn't settled next month, we'd think about blood tests, but not now. Come back or go to emergency straight away if the symptoms get worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 311.57,
      "end_seconds": 313.26,
      "duration_seconds": 1.69,
      "text": "Yes, will do."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 314.04,
      "end_seconds": 323.97,
      "duration_seconds": 9.93,
      "text": "I'd like to see you again in two weeks okay, is there anything you'd like me to go over again?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 325.97,
      "end_seconds": 329.85,
      "duration_seconds": 3.88,
      "text": "I mean, no, that's all. Thanks a lot."
    }
  ]
}